name duel-fulcrum-high-1
timeout 600

# THE ASYMMETRIC DUEL, GEOMETRY 4 OF 8: THE MiG HAS THE ENERGY. The exact mirror of
# duel-viper-high.fbm — the same 6,000 m / 100 kt split, handed to the other side. Nothing else
# differs, which is what makes the pair a measurement rather than two anecdotes.
#
# THIS IS THE MiG'S BEST DEFAULT-DOCTRINE CASE IN THE CAMPAIGN, and the reason to expect it to be: on
# duel-headon the two Rtrs sit within half a mile of each other (AIM-120 9.78 nm, R-27R 10.25) and the
# F-16's 81 s detection lead therefore buys it nothing at the trigger. Rtr is exactly the quantity
# height and speed move. If 6,000 m and 100 kt cannot turn the MiG's first shot into a kill, then what
# is missing is the SHOT and not the geometry, and the campaign says so with the two runs side by
# side.
#
# READING RULE: exit 3 (TIMEOUT), and it is the MiG's best DEFAULT-doctrine run in the campaign.
# MEASURED: 6,000 m and 100 kt lift the R-27R's Rtr from 10.25 to 15.12 nm and its Raero from 39.2 to
# 55.7, so the MiG shoots FIRST for the only time in the family (t=144.5 at 12.27 nm) and gets three
# rounds away while the F-16 never fires at all — its own trigger is still 2 nm out when its receiver
# lights up, and from then on it is beaming and spending all 60 chaff cartridges. The two R-27Rs arrive
# 11.24 m and 9.81 m out against a 13.8 m fuze: inside the ring, outside the lethal radius. So the
# energy is worth the first shot on this pairing and the first shot alone is not worth a kill — which
# is the same sentence duel-viper-high writes from the other seat.

unit viper
  team friendly
  module f16
  spawn 46.90000 6.40000 6000 90.0 400
  set gear up
  set fuel_pct 70
  set datalink off
  set fcr_mode crm
  set fcr_range_nm 40
  set rwr on
  set store 3 aim120
  set store 7 aim120
  set store 8 aim9
  set cmds_mode man
  set cmds_program 1
  set cmds_chaff 60
  set cmds_flare 60
  set brief_master_arm arm
  set task intercept
  wp 46.90000 8.40000 6000 400
  objective kill unit fulcrum
  objective survive

unit fulcrum
  team hostile
  module mig29
  spawn 46.90000 7.85000 12000 270.0 500
  set gear up
  set fuel_pct 70
  set n019_mode rad
  set n019_range_nm 27
  set n019_emission illum
  set rwr on
  set store 3 r27r
  set store 4 r27r
  set store 5 r73
  set brief_master_arm arm
  # THE CONTROLLER HAS TO SAY THE ANGELS, and on this geometry that is not a nicety. The N019's search
  # bar is +-6 deg in elevation (against the APG-68's +-10.5), and the intercept's Search state aims
  # the antenna at the BRIEFED band — which without a call is this jet's own altitude. Measured
  # without this line: 6,000 m of separation put the F-16 6.8 deg low at the gate range and the MiG
  # searched its own level for the whole 600 s (eng_detect_s = -1, not one contact). The F-16 in the
  # mirror mission needs no equivalent, and that IS the asymmetry: its bar is wide enough to cover the
  # split by itself.
  set brief_gci 20 270 99 6
  set task intercept
  wp 46.90000 5.85000 12000 500
  objective kill unit viper
  objective survive
